%% Deployment workflow
flowchart TD
  A[Change on branch] --> B{Which surface?}
  B -->|Vercel app| C[vercel env add + vercel --prod]
  B -->|n8n workflow| D[Edit draft in n8n Cloud UI]
  B -->|Metabase| E[Duplicate card, edit SQL]
  C --> V1[Verify /api/carousels + badge]
  D --> D2[Test on test chat/table] --> D3[Activate after approval]
  E --> E2[Cross-check vs SELECT] --> E3[Swap into dashboard]
  V1 --> R[Rollback: promote previous deploy]
  D3 --> R2[Rollback: workflow version restore]
  E3 --> R3[Rollback: revert to duplicate]
